IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTILORA-HUB.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CONCURRENT-TASKS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACTIVE-ADAPTERS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MEMORY-POOL-MB      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BATCHES-COUNT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MULTILORA-HUB.
    IF ACTIVE-ADAPTERS == 0 OR MEMORY-POOL-MB == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE CONCURRENT-TASKS TO BATCHES-COUNT.
    DIVIDE ACTIVE-ADAPTERS INTO BATCHES-COUNT.
    IF BATCHES-COUNT == 0
        MOVE 1 TO BATCHES-COUNT.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BATCHES-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 ACTIVE-ADAPTERS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
